          <p class="concept-b-lead">I lead software engineering teams and focus on Agent Engineering and AI. I’m a LangChain Certified Agent Engineer, with a foundation in FinTech, DeFi and payment systems.</p>
          <div class="concept-b-actions"><a href="/about/">Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/PedroMello_LangChain_Agent_Engineer_Certificate.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View certification <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
