    <section class="concept-b-section"><div class="container concept-b-section-grid"><p class="concept-b-index">Experience / 02</p><div><h2>Built on work where the details matter.</h2><p>My experience in FinTech, DeFi, payment rails and private capital markets continues to shape how I think about reliability, security and product constraints.</p><a href="/about/">Read more about my background ↗</a></div></div></section>
